# =====================================================================
# HPE VME 8.1.2 TROUBLESHOOTING COMMAND REFERENCE
# Format: Plain Text / Notepad-optimized tabular list
# =====================================================================

CATEGORY            COMMAND                         DESCRIPTION
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Virtualization      sudo virsh list --all           List all hosted VMs/domains
Virtualization      sudo virsh start <domain>       Power on a stopped VM
Virtualization      ps aux | grep qemu              Check active QEMU processes
Services            sudo morpheus-ctl status        Check VME/Morpheus services
Services            sudo morpheus-ctl stop          Stop all appliance services
Services            sudo morpheus-ctl start         Start all appliance services
Services            sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure   Reconfigure the manager app
Services            morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui   Tail live UI startup/error logs
Networking          ip a                            Show IP addresses & interfaces
Networking          ip route                        Display routing table
Networking          netplan try                     Validate & apply netplan config
Cluster Storage     pcs status                      Check cluster node status
Cluster Storage     pcs node standby <node>         Place cluster node into standby
Reset/Clean         /opt/hpe-vm/scripts/reset_host.sh Wipes broken local configurations
